---
config:
  theme: redux
  look: classic
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Discover Litho]
    B --> C[Read documentation]
    C --> D[Browse template marketplace]
    D --> E[Select and download template]
    E --> F[Initialize Litho project]
    F --> M_doc{" "}
    M_doc --> G[Write Markdown document]
    G --> M_val{" "}
    M_val --> H[Validate document]
    H --> I{Document valid?}

    I -- No --> J[Correct Markdown errors]
    J --> M_val

    I -- Yes --> K[Generate PDF]
    K --> L{PDF generated successfully?}

    L -- No --> M[Review compilation errors]
    M --> M_doc

    L -- Yes --> N[Review and download PDF]
    N --> O{Restore source later?}

    O -- Yes --> P[Upload PDF]
    P --> Q[Extract embedded Markdown]
    Q --> R[Edit or download restored source]
    R --> S([End])

    O -- No --> S
